<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Writing — Miss Texas 1988</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reporting and writing by Miss Texas 1988 for The Stranger." />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="assets/images/favicon-32.png" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="192x192" href="assets/images/favicon-192.png" />
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="assets/images/favicon-192.png" />
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="assets/images/favicon.ico" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syncopate:wght@400;700&family=Jost:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/styles.css" />
</head>
<body>

  <header class="site-header">
    <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary">
      <a class="nav-brand" href="index.html">Miss Texas 1988</a>
      <button class="nav-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="primary-nav" aria-label="Open menu">≡</button>
      <ul class="nav-links" id="primary-nav">
        <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="drag.html">Drag</a></li>
        <li><a href="writing.html">Writing</a></li>
        <li><a href="design.html">Design</a></li>
        <li><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="section wrap" style="padding-top: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem);">
      <div class="reveal" style="max-width: 820px;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Words / The Stranger</span>
        <h1 class="hero__title headline-rainbow" style="font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6.5rem);">
          <span class="word">Writing</span>
          <span class="word word--rotate">&amp; reporting.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero__lead" style="max-width: 56ch;">
          Reporter for <strong>The Stranger</strong>, Seattle's alt-weekly of record. Covering nightlife,
          queer culture, the city's stranger corners, and whatever else needs poking at this week.
        </p>
        <div class="hero__cta">
          <a class="btn btn--pink" href="https://www.thestranger.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read on The Stranger ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="scallop scallop--blue" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="marquee marquee--yellow" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="marquee__track">
        <span>Reporting</span><span>Criticism</span><span>Nightlife</span>
        <span>Queer culture</span><span>Seattle scene</span>
        <span>Reporting</span><span>Criticism</span><span>Nightlife</span>
        <span>Queer culture</span><span>Seattle scene</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="section wrap">
      <div class="note reveal">
        <strong>Heads up:</strong> the article cards below are ready to drop in. Send me article titles, links, dek/pull quotes, and dates and I'll wire them up — or you can edit <code>writing.html</code> directly. Each card supports tags, a pull quote, and a “Read on The Stranger” link.
      </div>

      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Selected work</span>
        <h2>Recent stories.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="articles mt-4">
        <a class="article article--feature reveal" href="#" data-tilt>
          <div class="article__meta">
            <span class="tag tag--pink">Feature</span>
            <span class="tag tag--yellow">The Stranger</span>
            <span>· Date</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="article__title">[Article title goes here — your biggest, splashiest piece]</h3>
          <p class="article__pull">"A pulled quote from the piece — something punchy, two lines max, sets the tone."</p>
          <p>A short standfirst / dek that gives the gist of the article and why it landed. Replace this with the article's lede or a one-paragraph summary.</p>
          <span class="article__readmore">Read on The Stranger ↗</span>
        </a>

        <a class="article reveal" href="#" data-tilt>
          <div class="article__meta">
            <span class="tag tag--blue">Profile</span>
            <span>· Date</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="article__title">[Article title — interview / profile piece]</h3>
          <p class="article__pull">"A short pull quote. Keep it short and quotable."</p>
          <p>One-paragraph summary or dek.</p>
          <span class="article__readmore">Read on The Stranger ↗</span>
        </a>

        <a class="article reveal" href="#" data-tilt>
          <div class="article__meta">
            <span class="tag tag--red">Review</span>
            <span>· Date</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="article__title">[Review or criticism piece]</h3>
          <p class="article__pull">"A line from the piece that captures the take."</p>
          <p>One-paragraph summary.</p>
          <span class="article__readmore">Read on The Stranger ↗</span>
        </a>

        <a class="article reveal" href="#" data-tilt>
          <div class="article__meta">
            <span class="tag tag--yellow">News</span>
            <span>· Date</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="article__title">[News / reporting piece]</h3>
          <p class="article__pull">"Quote that grounds the story."</p>
          <p>Summary paragraph.</p>
          <span class="article__readmore">Read on The Stranger ↗</span>
        </a>

        <a class="article reveal" href="#" data-tilt>
          <div class="article__meta">
            <span class="tag tag--pink">Essay</span>
            <span>· Date</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="article__title">[Personal essay / column]</h3>
          <p class="article__pull">"Quote."</p>
          <p>Summary.</p>
          <span class="article__readmore">Read on The Stranger ↗</span>
        </a>

        <a class="article reveal" href="#" data-tilt>
          <div class="article__meta">
            <span class="tag tag--blue">Coverage</span>
            <span>· Date</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="article__title">[Event coverage / on-the-ground]</h3>
          <p class="article__pull">"Quote."</p>
          <p>Summary.</p>
          <span class="article__readmore">Read on The Stranger ↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section wrap">
      <div class="bigstat reveal" style="background: var(--blue-electric); color: var(--cream);">
        <div class="bigstat__number" style="color: var(--yellow-butter);">↗</div>
        <div>
          <h3 style="color: var(--cream);">Pitch me.</h3>
          <p>Editors, publications, podcasts — open to freelance assignments on Seattle nightlife, queer culture, drag, and the occasional weird detour.</p>
          <a class="btn btn--pink" href="contact.html">Get in touch →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div>
        <img class="footer-logo" src="assets/images/mt-logo-dark.png" alt="Miss Texas 1988 logo" />
        <h4>Miss Texas 1988</h4>
        <p>Seattle-based drag artist, writer, and designer.<br/>For booking, press, or pixels — get in touch.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Site</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="drag.html">Drag</a></li>
          <li><a href="writing.html">Writing</a></li>
          <li><a href="design.html">Design</a></li>
          <li><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Find me</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://instagram.com/misstexas1988" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a></li>
          <li><a href="mailto:misstexas1988@gmail.com">Email</a></li>
          <li><a href="assets/files/Miss-Texas-1988-Drag-Resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Press kit (PDF)</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-fineprint">
      <span>© <span id="year"></span> Miss Texas 1988.</span>
      <span>Site stitched together with love + halftone dots.</span>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();</script>
  <script src="js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
